<title>AUSTRALIA: RTR-Australian Sept house materials prices fall.</title>
<headline>RTR-Australian Sept house materials prices fall.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian house building materials prices fell 0.2 percent in September from the previous month and were 0.5 percent lower than a year earlier, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said on Monday.</p>
<p>Other building materials prices fell 0.1 percent in September for a year on year rise of 0.2 percent.</p>
</text>
